OL,3,GNEWSA'My dad never forgot that one
OL,4,Ateacher's moment of kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "Just that thought of
OL,7,Fsomebody helping a little person like
OL,8,Fthat, it wasn't always the case [at the
OL,9,Ftime]."
